@api = http://localhost:5000

### Kiem tra dich vu - 200 OK
GET {{api}}/

### Lay danh sach bai tap - 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### Tao luot nop hop le - 201 Created
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 1,
  "studentCode": "dtc225201515",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/dtc225201515-cloud/CNTTK23D"
}

### Du lieu khong hop le - 400 Bad Request
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 0,
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### Doc lai luot nop vua tao - 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### Luot nop khong ton tai - 404 Not Found
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
